TEXT 544 48 Left 2 !; --- CÁLCULOS DE SALIDA (DC, RMS, FR, P) ---\n.meas TRAN Vdc AVG V(Vo) FROM 50m TO 100m\n.meas TRAN Vrms RMS V(Vo) FROM 50m TO 100m\n.meas TRAN Vac PARAM sqrt(Vrms*Vrms - Vdc*Vdc)\n.meas TRAN FR PARAM (Vac/Vdc)*100\n.meas TRAN P_activa AVG V(Vo)*I(R1) FROM 50m TO 100m\n \n; --- CÁLCULOS DE ENTRADA (S, PF) ---\n.meas TRAN Vs_rms RMS V(Vs) FROM 50m TO 100m\n.meas TRAN Is_rms RMS I(V1) FROM 50m TO 100m\n.meas TRAN S_aparente PARAM Vs_rms*Is_rms\n.meas TRAN PF PARAM P_activa/S_aparente
